<td style="width: 0.25in"></td><td style="width: 0.25in">b.</td><td style="text-align: justify">Pursuant to the Wellution Agreement, in connection with the closing of the Wellution Agreement, on March
22, 2023, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c27" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares">247,415</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares, <span style="-sec-ix-hidden: hidden-fact-43">no</span> par value per share (&#8220;Ordinary Shares&#8221;) to SciSparc and SciSparc
issued <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c26" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockholdersEquityOtherShares" scale="0" unitRef="shares">360,297</ix:nonFraction> of its ordinary shares to the Company in a share exchange, (collectively, the &#8220;Exchange Shares&#8221;), representing
approximately <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c26" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="jfbr:ShareIssuedAndOutstandingPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure">2.97</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c28" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="jfbr:ShareIssuedAndOutstandingPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure">4.99</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively, of the Company&#8217;s and SciSparc&#8217;s issued and outstanding ordinary shares. The number
of Exchange Shares acquired by each company was calculated by dividing $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c26" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="jfbr:NumberOfExchangeSharesAcquired" scale="3" unitRef="usd">288</ix:nonFraction> thousand by the average closing price of the relevant company&#8217;s
shares on the Nasdaq Capital Market for the 30 consecutive trading days ending on the third trading day immediately prior to the closing.</td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">The investment in SciSparc was accounted
for as financial asset through profit and loss.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in">&#160;</p>

